  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing — task 202 identified 3 nice-to-have rows explicitly deferred past task 186. Extension — 203d applies them AFTER 186 so any real-world lessons fold in. Cost-of-doing-nothing — without A32 the skill still writes Ready itself (redundant with H13's authoritative write; harmless but polish); without A33 operators may forget the BFF-artifact ordering constraint (SESSION 5 fail-cycle risk); without A34 SC #11 dev-leakage + env-var checks stay skipped (audit gap remains open). None of these BLOCK task 186; all IMPROVE the operator experience going forward. If A34 touches BFF, NFR-01 publish-size verification REQUIRED (baseline 44.96 MB; expected delta ≈0 MB).</notes>

